From: doubletake PR #61 (https://github.com/omarroth/doubletake/pull/61, head 962b47f6), ported to open-airplay 1e879a98
Subject: Fall back to NTP when a PTP receiver names no timeline

Samsung and LG receivers advertise PTP but omit timingPeerInfo.ClockID in
the SETUP response. Retry such a receiver once over NTP on a re-verified
connection. Ported by hand: open-airplay changed prepareVideoCapture to
take a VideoProfile. LGPL-3.0-or-later, as upstream.

